  "name": "Maladaptive Schema Scale (MSS)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Maladaptive Schema Scale (MSS) is a 108-item tool that assesses maladaptive patterns of thoughts, behaviours and emotions. It measures 27 schemas, integrating traditional early maladaptive schemas described by Jeffery Young and additional schemas based on attachment, trauma and other contemporary research.",
